{"records":[{"participants":["ACC-B1"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-memo-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/memo/paragraph-1"}],"summary":"The owner or controller of account ACC-B1 is unknown. No login audit records were provided with the case packet; the memo treats this absence as an evidence limitation and does not identify a person who controls the account.","timestamp_text":null},{"participants":["Bob Niran","ACC-B1"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-interview-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/interview/bob/paragraph-2"}],"summary":"The interview summary identifies Bob Niran as a person mentioned during the interview, but investigators state that the available information does not establish that he controls account ACC-B1 and does not verify him as its account holder.","timestamp_text":null},{"participants":["ACC-B1","Bob Niran"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-registry-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/account-registry/acc-b1"}],"summary":"The account-registry excerpt lists ACC-B1 as active but leaves the owner and controller fields blank. It contains an internal account label and creation date, but no identity-verification record, customer identifier, or provider signature connecting the account to Bob Niran or another individual.","timestamp_text":null}]}